---
const title = 'Data Deletion Instructions – WeFitNest';
const description = 'WeFitNest stores all data locally on your device. Learn how to delete your data at any time.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="WeFitNest" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f9f9f9;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      header {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      header .logo {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2196f3 0%, #00bcd4 60%, #14cba8 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }

      header .logo span {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 48px auto;
        padding: 0 24px 64px;
      }

      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .updated {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #777;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .intro {
        background: #f0effe;
        border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .intro p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #3730a3;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #4f46e5;
        margin-top: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0ff;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ol, ul {
        padding-left: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      ol li, ul li {
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      strong {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .contact-email {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .contact-email:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .policy-link {
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .policy-link:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #aaa;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
        margin-top: 48px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <header>
      <a class="logo" href="/">WeFitNest</a>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

      <h1 class="page-title">Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: May 29, 2026</p>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          WeFitNest stores all user data <strong>locally on your device</strong> and does <strong>not</strong>
          create online accounts or store information on external servers.
          You can delete your data at any time using either method below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Delete All Data by Deleting the App</h2>
      <p>
        All personal data—including profile information, photos, workout logs, nutrition logs, and barcode keys—is stored only on your device.
      </p>
      <p>To delete all data permanently:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Press and hold the <strong>WeFitNest</strong> app icon on your home screen</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Remove App</strong></li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Delete App</strong></li>
      </ol>
      <p>This permanently removes all data associated with the app from your device.</p>

      <h2>2. Reset Data From Within the App</h2>
      <p>You can erase all locally stored data without deleting the app:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the app and go to the <strong>Profile</strong> tab</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>App Settings</strong></li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Reset All Data</strong></li>
        <li>Confirm the deletion when prompted</li>
      </ol>
      <p>This will permanently erase all your profile information, workout history, nutrition logs, and stored keys.</p>

      <h2>3. No External Data Storage</h2>
      <p>WeFitNest does <strong>not</strong>:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create user accounts</li>
        <li>Store data on external servers</li>
        <li>Sync data to the cloud</li>
        <li>Share data with third parties</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Because of this, <strong>no external deletion request is required</strong>.</p>

      <h2>4. Future Cloud Features (Not Active Yet)</h2>
      <p>If cloud backup or account features are added in the future:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You will be notified</li>
        <li>You will be able to request deletion of cloud-stored data</li>
        <li>This page will be updated accordingly</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Contact for Support</h2>
      <p>If you need help deleting your data or have questions, contact us at:</p>
      <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:support@wefitnest.com">support@wefitnest.com</a>

    </div>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2026 WeFitNest. All rights reserved. &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a class="policy-link" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
      &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a class="policy-link" href="/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
